From: Wasmer Engineering <engineering@wasmer.io>
Subject: [PATCH] Use runtime GC info registration with GCC

GCC reports section type conflicts when GCInfoTrait instantiations with
internal and external linkage share gc_info_section. Keep the runtime
registration path for GCC builds.

diff --git a/gni/v8.gni b/gni/v8.gni
--- a/gni/v8.gni
+++ b/gni/v8.gni
@@ -249,5 +249,5 @@
 
   cppgc_enable_object_section_gcinfo =
-      (is_linux || is_mac) && !is_component_build
+      (is_linux || is_mac) && !is_component_build && is_clang
 
   # Enable support for larger cages, up to 16GB.
